Supabase Studio and postgres-meta run as unmodified pinned upstream images
(Apache-2.0, Supabase), started on demand per environment; no Studio source is copied
into the sbarbase code.

The platform console's stylesheet (ui/style.css) ports design material from the
Supabase UI package, supabase/supabase packages/ui and packages/config at commit
7425d4930528931400fb3e656e860b1094cb224e: the semantic colour tokens of
build/css/source/semantic.css and build/css/themes/light.css and dark.css, resolved to
literal values, and the visual recipes of the Button, Input, Textarea, Card, Alert,
Badge and Table components and the focus-ring utility, rewritten as plain CSS.
